rule value_error v1
description "A rule named like a builtin the service of Connect catches where the rule reads a date"

inputs
  due : date  range >=2020-01-01 <=2030-12-31

outputs
  fee : money[USD]  round down(1USD)

table fee_by_due
policy unique
| due          | -> fee |
| <2025-01-01  | 3USD   |
| >=2025-01-01 | 1USD   |
